 "stimulus_html": "Determine whether the ordered pair is a solution to the system.\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}\n  \\quad \\quad \\quad \\, \\, \\, y = \\frac{2}{3}x + 1 \\\\\n   - 2x + 3y = 5  \\\\ \n\\end{array}  \\right.\">\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}\n  y = \\frac{2}{3}x + 1  \\\\\n   - 2x + 3y = 5  \\\\ \n\\end{array}  \\right.</span>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 511425,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"(3, 3)\">(3, 3)</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{y = \\frac{2}{3}x + 1}\\\\\n{ - 2x + 3y = 5}\n\\end{array}} \\right.\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Test (3, 3).</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"3 = \\frac{2}{3}\\left( 3 \\right) + 1\"></span></td>\n<td>Substitute into the first equation.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"3 = 2 + 1\"></span></td>\n<td>This is true.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\" - 2\\left( 3 \\right) + 3\\left( 3 \\right) = 5\"></span></td>\n<td>Substitute into the second equation.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\" - 6 + 9 = 5\"></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{3  =  5}}\"></span></td>\n<td>This is not true. This ordered pair is not a solution to the system.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "No"
    }
